    "detailed_description": "<strong>To Arms Mercenaries!</strong><br><br>As war rages, and the army is busy on the battlefield, It's up to you to do the dirty job.<br><br>As king started a campaign to retake Old Kingdom of Dwarfs, Te`Ren Shatqal, Our Kingdom is in danger as it was never before.<br><br>Viir, the cave dwellers, Is at the gates to our Kingdom. They dig their tunnels, ambush our citizens, steal our resources!<br><br>Assemble the Group, up to 4 Dwarfs.<br>Or<br>Test Yourself and go on the mission alone.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gather resources.<br></li><li><br></li><li>Craft new Weapons and Armor.<br></li><li><br></li><li>Enchant them with Runes and Mechanisms.<br></li><li><br></li><li>Stop the Viir's advance!</li></ul><br>The Kingdom counts on <strong>You</strong>.",
